This split was re-frozen on 2026-09-09 after the Phase 1 general
question-type expansion (41 seed groups; seven answer types). Per
plan.md, do not regenerate or edit data/splits.json (or the
seed-to-split assignment in make_splits.py) until Phase 7's final run. Phase 2
decomposer training uses train only; Phase 3 recall@5 evaluation
uses a separate held-out requirement->passage set, not these
task splits; Phase 5 bandit training/eval uses train/val only.
